    "updated_at": "2021-10-14T00:13:41Z",
    "body": "The Promise returned by the `readValue()` call should not settle until pairing is complete. However, the current implementation only allows a single pending pairing operation and so if additional calls to `readValue()` are made they will fail until pairing is complete.",
