    "created_at": "2021-10-14T00:17:10Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-10-14T00:17:10Z",
    "body": "The implementation bug is that Windows supports multiple concurrent calls to `readValue()` but our implementation of automatic pairing doesn't so without the secure characteristic this code works fine but when pairing is required it fails.\r\n\r\nSadly even if we fix the implementation of automatic pairing on Windows to support concurrent calls other platforms (Android and macOS) do not and so your code will need to use a Promise queue either way.",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
    "pin": null,
