    "created_at": "2023-05-22T17:54:03Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-05-22T17:54:03Z",
    "body": "> The implementation bug is that Windows supports multiple concurrent calls to readValue() but our implementation of automatic pairing doesn't so without the secure characteristic this code works fine but when pairing is required it fails.\r\n\r\nI confirm, disabling Nimble \"Security manager secure connections\" solved my issue.",
